  "term": "psychic pain",
  "definition": "Psychic pain is painful inner mental or emotional distress linked here to feelings of internal fragmentation or loss of self-cohesion. In this context, altered states may be sought for temporary relief from that distress, as an escape from a divided inner experience.",
